{"id":"77d1a531e7662d98","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-calculus-of-constructions.md","title":"Calculus of Constructions","display":"df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-calculus-of-constructions","aliases":["72-df-calculus-of-constructions"],"display":"df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions","depends_on":["[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Coquand–Huet, The Calculus of Constructions, Information and Computation 76 (1988) 95–120, §§2–3, https://www.asc.ohio-state.edu/pollard.4/type/readings/coc88.pdf; Handbook X print692/PDF704; bibliography print776/PDF788","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-calculus-of-constructions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-calculus-of-constructions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-calculus-of-constructions — Calculus of Constructions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Coquand–Huet, The Calculus of Constructions, Information and Computation 76 (1988) 95–120, §§2–3, <a href=\"https://www.asc.ohio-state.edu/pollard.4/type/readings/coc88.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.asc.ohio-state.edu/pollard.4/type/readings/coc88.pdf</a>; Handbook X print692/PDF704; bibliography print776/PDF788"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 是不同常元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\">\\(V_t\\)</span>、避免捕获代入、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_C\">\\(\\beta_C\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_{\\beta_C}\">\\(=_{\\beta_C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li>上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是变量不重复的有限声明序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark\\)</span> 是上下文判断；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\)</span> 是类型判断。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_C\">\\(U_C\\)</span> 是这两类判断的互不相交编码集。规则及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>；所有新扩充变量不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;:=V_t\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A,M\\in E_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_C&amp;:=\\left(\\bigcup_nE_n\\right)/{=_\\alpha},\\qquad\\mathcal S_C:=\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_C:=\\mathcal S_C\\times\\mathcal S_C.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;:=V_t\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A,M\\in E_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_C&amp;:=\\left(\\bigcup_nE_n\\right)/{=_\\alpha},\\qquad\\mathcal S_C:=\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_C:=\\mathcal S_C\\times\\mathcal S_C.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_C:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\langle\\rangle\\vdash\\checkmark}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Prop}:\\mathsf{Type}}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s}{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash\\checkmark}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash M:A}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s_1\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:s_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s_2}:\\langle s_1,s_2\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:\\Pi x:A.B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\Pi x:A.B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B[N/x]}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash M:B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\land A=_{\\beta_C}B\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CoC}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathcal E_C,\\mathcal S_C,\\mathcal A_C,\\mathcal R_C,R_C\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_C:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\langle\\rangle\\vdash\\checkmark}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Prop}:\\mathsf{Type}}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s}{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash\\checkmark}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash M:A}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s_1\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:s_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s_2}:\\langle s_1,s_2\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:\\Pi x:A.B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\Pi x:A.B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B[N/x]}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash M:B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\land A=_{\\beta_C}B\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CoC}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathcal E_C,\\mathcal S_C,\\mathcal A_C,\\mathcal R_C,R_C\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里给出经典CoC的二sort PTS呈现，四对product sort全部允许；旧稿漏掉的(Prop,Type)会排除依赖于项的类型族。Type没有更高sort公理，特别没有Type:Type。此处不把本书Nuprl体系等同于CoC；CoC的原始出处是Coquand–Huet。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}$ 是不同常元，$V_t$、避免捕获代入、$\\beta_C$ 和 $=_{\\beta_C}$ 见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"上下文 $\\Gamma$ 是变量不重复的有限声明序列。$\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark$ 是上下文判断；$\\Gamma\\vdash M:A$ 是类型判断。$U_C$ 是这两类判断的互不相交编码集。规则及 $\\operatorname{Cl}$ 使用 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]；所有新扩充变量不在 $\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"V_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_C","display":false},{"tex":"=_{\\beta_C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A","display":false},{"tex":"U_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&:=V_t\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&:=E_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A,M\\in E_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_C&:=\\left(\\bigcup_nE_n\\right)/{=_\\alpha},\\qquad\\mathcal S_C:=\\{\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_C&:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_C:=\\mathcal S_C\\times\\mathcal S_C.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_C:=&\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\langle\\rangle\\vdash\\checkmark}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Prop}:\\mathsf{Type}}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s}{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash\\checkmark}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash\\checkmark}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash M:A}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:s_1\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:s_2}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s_2}:\\langle s_1,s_2\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi x:A.B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:\\Pi x:A.B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\Pi x:A.B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B[N/x]}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:s}{\\Gamma\\vdash M:B}:s\\in\\mathcal S_C\\land A=_{\\beta_C}B\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C M:A&:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_C}(R_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CoC}&:=\\langle\\mathcal E_C,\\mathcal S_C,\\mathcal A_C,\\mathcal R_C,R_C\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3243,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正